TION (MATCH LUXURY AESTHETIC):\nThe subject wears the uploaded luxury garment. Automatically complete the full outfit to feel cohesive, timeless, and aligned with international high-end casual-elite style:\n- Pair with tailored premium straight-leg dark wash jeans (classic refined silhouette, no distressing).\n- Add clean minimalist white leather sneakers (understated luxury, no logos).\n- Include subtle premium accessories: a neutral-toned leather travel duffel bag and classic sunglasses (if not already present on the model).\n- No overly trendy, cheap, or flashy elements.\n\n---\n\n## SCENE & ENVIRONMENT:\nPlace the subject in a **spacious ultra-luxury resort villa lobby**:\n- Polished light marble floors, modern minimalist decor, floor-to-ceiling windows with soft golden natural light, and subtle background greenery.\n- The atmosphere is pristine, refined, and exclusive, with warm elegant natural glow.\n- The background stays subtle, keeping focus on the subject and outfit.\n\n---\n\n## QUALITY & STYLE REQUIREMENTS:\n- Photorealistic high-fidelity photograph, professional soft golden-hour lighting consistent across the subject and scene.\n- Realistic fabric physics (natural draping, wrinkles matching the subject's pose).\n- High-end editorial fashion aesthetic, sharp focus on garment details, clean composition, no over-editing.\n- Sophisticated, calm, aspirational vibe matching luxury brand imagery.\n\n---\n\n## STRICTLY FORBIDDEN:\n- No upper-body-only or cropped images.\n- No modifying the model's face or the uploaded garment's details (fabric/color/design).\n- No cheap, overly casual, or out-of-style clothing/accessories.\n- No changing the scene to anything other than the luxury villa lobby.\n- No adding hallucinated details to the garment not present in the uploaded reference."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 30, "type": "CR Text", "p